# npm pack smoke-test artifacts (any version)
aixle-insights-*.tgz

# Local runtime artifacts — never commit.
# `state-<hostname>-<token-hash>.json` embeds Claude/Cursor session UUIDs and
# `credentials.json` holds a bearer token. Both are written into this directory
# when the CLI runs from a source checkout.
#
# These rules live here, not in the repo-root .gitignore, so a folder rename
# cannot orphan them. That is exactly how state-localhost-523d45af.json got
# committed: the root rules still pointed at /packages/tools/db90-mcp/ after
# the db90-mcp -> db90-telemetry-mcp -> aixle-insights renames. (AIX-559)
#
# Anchored with a leading `/`: the CLI only ever writes these at the package
# root, and unanchored patterns would silently make a future
# src/test/fixtures/state-*.json uncommittable.
/credentials.json
/state-*.json
